+### Fix
+
+Use `SafeERC20.forceApprove(usdt, address(aavePool), amount)` instead of `usdt.approve(...)`.
+`forceApprove` tolerates a missing return value and resets the allowance to zero first, which USDT
+also requires for non-zero-to-non-zero changes. Better still, set the Aave allowance once in the
+constructor with `forceApprove(usdt, aavePool, type(uint256).max)` and drop the per-deposit approve
+entirely. Add a fork test to CI so a token that does not return a bool can never pass again.
